5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Let's figure this out together! I think we should check the Ward complaint log for this point and the statements at the residents' meeting to see how everyone feels.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a lovely start, Kenji. I would like to look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and a visit to the station block's bin house.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll look into the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and the supervised mornings on the next lane to understand the actual workload.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point! I want to know if it's fair for everyone.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe it would be wise to examine the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs to understand our financial footing.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, it's great that you're thinking about fairness. Since we've already covered a lot, maybe I'll also check the truck arrival time from the crew leader to see when the bins actually go.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think we have a very thorough list started. I will stick with my choices for now and wait to see what we all discover.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Shizue. We have a comprehensive set of data points; there is no need to add more and complicate the process.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll stick with my two as well! I'm really curious about those measurements and the complaints.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I shall also remain with my selections. It is important that we approach this with a clear mind and a full understanding of the costs involved.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm happy with my choices then! I'll stick with the complaint log, the residents' meeting statements, and the truck arrival time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
